  "question": {
    "text": "A bullet is fired from a gun. The force on the bullet is given by <math><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></math> where <math><mi>F</mi></math> is in newton and <math><mi>t</mi></math> in second. The force on the bullet becomes zero as soon as it leaves the barrel. What is the average impulse imparted to the bullet?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>9&nbsp;Ns</mtext> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>1</mtext><mtext>.8&nbsp;Ns</mtext></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>0</mtext><mtext>.9&nbsp;Ns</mtext> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow>  <mtext>0</mtext><mtext>.3&nbsp;Ns</mtext> </mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⟹</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><br />Impulese <math>&nbsp;<mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>600</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msubsup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>"
  }
